A style of semantics which defines evaluation via ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/evaluation-statement-judgement.td")} of the form $t \to t'$, specifying how a term reduces by one atomic step at a time until reaching a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/normal-form.td")}.
